  "privacyYourProfileTheNameUsername": "Your profile. The name, username and picture you choose (a picture you upload is stored so other players can see it), the world, piece sets and aura you wear, and your coin balance.",
  "@privacyYourProfileTheNameUsername": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyGamesTheGamesYouPlay": "Games. The games you play and their moves and results, your coin history (coins are virtual, have no cash value and can't be cashed out), and the items you own or rent. In Guess My Doodle, what you draw is shown live to the players in that game and kept only until the turn is over; a game's chat and guesses are deleted a day after it ends.",
  "@privacyGamesTheGamesYouPlay": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyPurchasesIfYouBuyCoins": "Purchases. If you buy coins, Apple or Google take the payment, and we never see your card or bank details. We get the purchase's ID, the pack, when it was bought and whether it was refunded, so we can add your coins once and take them back if the payment is refunded. If you join Chip Maestro, Apple or Google handle the subscription; we keep its ID, plan and renewal dates so we know you're a member.",
  "@privacyPurchasesIfYouBuyCoins": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyMessagesChatMessagesAndVoice": "Messages. Chat messages and voice notes you send in games and to friends. Voice notes are only available to the players in that game.",
  "@privacyMessagesChatMessagesAndVoice": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyFriendsFriendRequestsAndYour": "Friends. Friend requests and your friends list.",
  "@privacyFriendsFriendRequestsAndYour": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyReportsWhenYouReportA": "Reports. When you report a bug or suggest a feature: what you write, an optional screenshot, an optional email for follow-up, and the app version, phone system, screen and world you were in.",
  "@privacyReportsWhenYouReportA": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyCrashReportsIfTheApp": "Crash reports. If the app crashes, a report of what went wrong (the error, your phone's model and system version, and the app version) goes to Sentry, which helps us fix it. It doesn't include your name, messages or anything you've made.",
  "@privacyCrashReportsIfTheApp": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyHowYouUseUtopiaWhen": "How you use Utopia. When the app opens, the screens you go to, and when you finish a game, buy something, earn a reward, share an invite or chat with Chip (not what you say), so we can see what works and fix what doesn't. It stays in our own database: it's never sold or given to advertisers, and it's deleted with your account.",
  "@privacyHowYouUseUtopiaWhen": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyChipWhenYouChatWith": "Chip. When you chat with Chip, your messages and some context from the app (your first name, the time, the screen and world you're on, and your coins, worlds and aura) are used to write his replies. Your conversation is kept on your phone until you start a new chat. Chip can also keep a few short notes about things you tell him, like a plan or a favourite world, so he can follow up next time; ask him to forget and he deletes them. If you send Chip a photo, it's used to draw your picture and isn't kept on our servers; it stays on your phone until you start a new chat, and a picture drawn from it is visible only to you. When Chip colors a picture for you, the picture is sent to him to choose the colors. A real portrait is drawn from your photo or the name you give. One from your photo is kept privately for you; one of a famous person is shared with other Chip Maestro members who ask for them. If you let Chip see what you're playing in other apps, the title and artist of the song, video or podcast are used for his reaction to it.",
  "@privacyChipWhenYouChatWith": {
    "description": "features/support/presentation/privacy_screen.dart"
  },
  "privacyYourSketchbookDrawingsAreKept": "Your Sketchbook drawings are kept only on your phone, unless you choose to save one to your photos.",
